{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":36.31999969482422,"text":"Five insurers. Pages of fine print. Are you actually covered? Are you overpaying? Meet Service Haggle, your personal insurance agent. It reads every policy, knows exactly what you're covered for, and watches the market and your life. Drive less? Got a raise? It notices. When you're overpaying, a swarm of agents calls and emails every insurer at once, using each offer to beat the next. Same coverage, $756 a year. Back in your pocket. Service Haggle, never overpay again.","words":[{"word":"Five","start":0.0,"end":0.47999998927116394},{"word":"insurers","start":0.47999998927116394,"end":1.100000023841858},{"word":"Pages","start":2.0999999046325684,"end":2.0999999046325684},{"word":"of","start":2.0999999046325684,"end":2.4600000381469727},{"word":"fine","start":2.4600000381469727,"end":2.819999933242798},{"word":"print","start":2.819999933242798,"end":3.200000047683716},{"word":"Are","start":3.7799999713897705,"end":3.799999952316284},{"word":"you","start":3.799999952316284,"end":4.059999942779541},{"word":"actually","start":4.059999942779541,"end":4.639999866485596},{"word":"covered","start":4.639999866485596,"end":4.880000114440918},{"word":"Are","start":5.360000133514404,"end":5.480000019073486},{"word":"you","start":5.480000019073486,"end":5.699999809265137},{"word":"overpaying","start":5.699999809265137,"end":6.300000190734863},{"word":"Meet","start":7.039999961853027,"end":7.099999904632568},{"word":"Service","start":7.099999904632568,"end":7.599999904632568},{"word":"Haggle","start":7.599999904632568,"end":7.920000076293945},{"word":"your","start":8.279999732971191,"end":8.479999542236328},{"word":"personal","start":8.479999542236328,"end":8.979999542236328},{"word":"insurance","start":8.979999542236328,"end":9.479999542236328},{"word":"agent","start":9.479999542236328,"end":9.819999694824219},{"word":"It","start":10.520000457763672,"end":10.520000457763672},{"word":"reads","start":10.